msgid "配置与版本"
msgstr "Configuration and versions"

msgid "输出树"
msgstr "Output tree"

msgid "默认 ``O=out/x86_64/release``；支持 ``ARCH=x86_64`` 和 ``PROFILE=release|debug``。例如::"
msgstr ""
"The default is ``O=out/x86_64/release``; ``ARCH=x86_64`` and ``PROFILE=release|debug`` are "
"supported. For example::"

msgid ""
"当前配置是 ``O/.config``。olddefconfig 保留设置并补新项；defconfig 重置。 空输出目录首次运行 olddefconfig 或 menuconfig "
"时，也先载入相同的项目种子。 ``configs/default.conf`` 是默认配置种子；完整结果由原版 Kconfig 生成。 不能把镜像策略混入内核私有配置。ReliefNT "
"的配置只在其独立仓库维护， 不会 source 主仓的应用、镜像、授权或 QEMU 配置。"
msgstr ""
"The active configuration is ``O/.config``. olddefconfig preserves settings and adds new options; "
"defconfig resets them. The first olddefconfig or menuconfig run in an empty output directory also "
"loads the same project seed first. ``configs/default.conf`` is the default configuration seed; "
"upstream Kconfig generates the complete result. Image policy must not be mixed into private kernel"
" configuration. ReliefNT configuration is maintained only in its separate repository and does not "
"source application, image, authorization, or QEMU configuration from this repository."

msgid "菜单与实际作用"
msgstr "Menus and their effects"

msgid ""
"主菜单按系统镜像、授权策略、软件仓库、可选用户态组件和 QEMU 运行参数分组。 镜像尺寸是构建工具的最低容量请求，工具仍会按文件大小和分区开销扩大输出。 QEMU 的 "
"CPU、内存、显示和网络参数只控制来宾启动命令，不编译内核功能。"
msgstr ""
"The main menu groups system images, authorization policy, software repositories, optional "
"userspace components, and QEMU runtime parameters. Image size is a minimum capacity request to the"
" build tools; the tools may still enlarge output to accommodate files and partition overhead. QEMU"
" CPU, memory, display, and network parameters control only the guest launch command and do not "
"compile kernel features."

msgid ""
"编译策略使用 ``PROFILE=release`` 或 ``PROFILE=debug``，显示命令用 ``V=1``。 旧 BUILD "
"预设、优化/LTO/符号/剥离开关已经不被生产链消费，现已移除； 测试按明确的 Make 目标运行，校验和与归属文件由相应产品规则保证， 不提供能跳过这些规则的虚设开关。"
msgstr ""
"Select build policy with ``PROFILE=release`` or ``PROFILE=debug``; use ``V=1`` to display "
"commands. The old BUILD presets and optimization/LTO/symbol/stripping switches were no longer "
"consumed by the production pipeline and have been removed. Tests run through explicit Make "
"targets. Checksums and ownership files are enforced by the relevant product rules; there are no "
"dummy switches to bypass those rules."

msgid "Legacy framebuffer 外观仅控制保留程序读取的 display.conf； XDM 使用自己的 Xresources，IceWM 使用自己的主题，均不由该选项改变。"
msgstr ""
"The legacy framebuffer appearance option controls only display.conf as read by retained programs. "
"XDM uses its own Xresources and IceWM its own themes; this option changes neither."

msgid "组件选择"
msgstr "Component selection"

msgid ""
"``configs/components.toml`` 是组件身份、依赖和默认策略的唯一清单。 维护后运行 ``make regen-component-kconfig``，检查生成的 "
"Kconfig.components。 每个可选组件有独立子菜单；required 组件固定启用，不生成可关闭的选项。"
msgstr ""
"``configs/components.toml`` is the sole manifest for component identity, dependencies, and default"
" policy. After editing it, run ``make regen-component-kconfig`` and inspect the generated "
"Kconfig.components. Each optional component has its own submenu; required components are always "
"enabled and have no disable option."

msgid "BUILD：启用组件。依赖可自动启用它；第三方库也可能因其他产物需要而被构建。"
msgstr ""
"BUILD: enables the component. Dependencies can enable it automatically; third-party libraries may "
"also be built because other artifacts need them."

msgid "IMAGE：把启用的组件纳入系统载荷。静态库可用 image_supported=false 明确声明 没有独立运行时载荷，这类组件不生成 IMAGE 开关。"
msgstr ""
"IMAGE: includes an enabled component in the system payload. A static library can explicitly "
"declare image_supported=false to indicate that it has no standalone runtime payload; such "
"components have no IMAGE switch."

msgid "ENTRY：控制旧应用注册表的入口，依赖 IMAGE。它不会改写 X11 程序提供的 desktop 文件；原生 X11 菜单和 MIME 行为仍由这些文件定义。库没有应用入口开关。"
msgstr ""
"ENTRY: controls the entry in the legacy application registry and depends on IMAGE. It does not "
"rewrite desktop files provided by X11 programs; those files still define native X11 menus and MIME"
" behavior. Libraries have no application-entry switch."

msgid ""
"当前 musl SDK 是产品规则定义的固定 sysroot；组件 SDK 开关没有控制它，已移除。 API 包也没有对应的可选生产目标，不生成 API 开关。组件元数据保留原格式的 "
"SDK/API 字段供兼容读取，不能由这些字段推断 SDK 实际文件；以安装清单为准。"
msgstr ""
"The current musl SDK is a fixed sysroot defined by product rules; component SDK switches did not "
"control it and have been removed. API packages likewise have no optional production target, so no "
"API switch is generated. Component metadata retains the original SDK/API fields for compatible "
"readers; these fields do not establish the SDK's actual contents. Consult the installation "
"manifest."

msgid "旧配置与检查"
msgstr "Old configurations and checks"

msgid ""
"现有 O/.config 先备份，再执行 olddefconfig 与 config-sync，原版 Kconfig 会去掉 已删除及不属于本仓的符号。更早的 LEON_COMPONENT "
"名称先用 migrate-config 显式迁移， 该步骤保留备份并拒绝冲突；不要直接用默认配置覆盖用户选择。 未被构建链使用的重复默认模板已删除。"
msgstr ""
"Back up an existing O/.config before running olddefconfig and config-sync. Upstream Kconfig "
"removes deleted symbols and symbols outside this repository. Explicitly migrate older "
"LEON_COMPONENT names with migrate-config first; it keeps a backup and rejects conflicts. Do not "
"overwrite user selections directly with defaults. Unused duplicate default templates have been "
"removed."

msgid ""
"``tests/build/test-kconfig-contract.sh`` 检查原生依赖、独立镜像/入口选择、 无效控制项和配置稳定性；config-groups 与 config-"
"first-build 检查并发、增量、 缺失产物修复及首次构建。它们使用真实原版 conf，不以文本替换代替 Kconfig 求值。"
msgstr ""
"``tests/build/test-kconfig-contract.sh`` checks native dependencies, independent image/entry "
"selection, ineffective controls, and configuration stability. config-groups and config-first-build"
" check concurrency, incremental builds, missing-artifact repair, and first builds. They use the "
"real upstream conf, not text substitution in place of Kconfig evaluation."

msgid "版本身份"
msgstr "Version identity"

msgid ""
"主仓与内核分别读取自己的 ``configs/build-version``。主仓 ``system/rootfs/etc/os-release`` 的 VERSION_ID 必须与发布版本一致。"
" 生成头只写 O；源码身份与数字发布版本分开。内核后缀例如::"
msgstr ""
"This repository and the kernel each read their own ``configs/build-version``. VERSION_ID in this "
"repository's ``system/rootfs/etc/os-release`` must match the release version. Generated headers "
"are written only to O; source identity is separate from the numeric release version. Example "
"kernel suffix::"

msgid ""
"完整内核版本最多 31 字节，后缀仅接受已允许字符。包元数据仍使用数字基础版本。 SOURCE_DATE_EPOCH 默认为提交时间；不得递增源码计数器或用当前时钟破坏可重现性。 旧输出的 "
"``config/.config`` 可复制为新输出的 ``.config``，再 olddefconfig。"
msgstr ""
"The complete kernel version is limited to 31 bytes; suffixes accept only allowed characters. "
"Package metadata continues to use the numeric base version. SOURCE_DATE_EPOCH defaults to the "
"commit timestamp; do not increment source counters or use the current clock to break "
"reproducibility. An old output's ``config/.config`` can be copied to ``.config`` in the new "
"output, followed by olddefconfig."
